# Always store LF in the repository, hand out the platform's native form on
# checkout. Without this, commits made on Windows go in with CRLF and every
# contributor on Linux or macOS sees the whole file as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.woff2 binary
